Package: p3-fancurve
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Gonzalez <dev@gonzalezerik.com>
Depends: python3, acpi-call-dkms
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gonzalezerik/p3-tiny-fancurve
Description: Fixed fan speed for the Lenovo ThinkStation P3 Tiny Gen 2
 Pins the embedded controller's fan to a constant level (about 2000, 2400,
 5970 or 6950 rpm) by setting its fan-level flag byte through the firmware's
 own ACPI methods, with a full-speed safety override on high CPU temperature.
